+<!DOCTYPE html>
+<html lang="en">
+<head>
+  <meta charset="UTF-8">
+  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
+  <meta name="referrer" content="no-referrer">
+  <title>Your Privacy | The Daily Grind</title>
+  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/styles.css">
+</head>
+<body>
+  <nav aria-label="Main navigation"><a class="logo" href="/">THE DAILY GRIND</a><a href="/">Back to home</a></nav>
+  <main class="container policy">
+    <p>THE DAILY GRIND · YOUR PRIVACY</p>
+    <h1>Good coffee. Less data.</h1>
+    <p class="intro">You can explore this site without an account, tracking cookies, or sharing personal details.</p>
+    <h2>Only what’s needed to deliver a page</h2>
+    <p>Your browser sends technical information, such as your IP address and the page requested, so the server can deliver the site. The application does not store that information or create visitor profiles.</p>
+    <p>This site has no account system, checkout, or data collection forms. Please do not include personal details in page URLs.</p>
+    <h2>No tracking or browser storage</h2>
+    <p>We do not use analytics, advertising pixels, cookies, local storage, or fingerprinting. There are no optional tracking features to enable, so there is no cookie consent banner to dismiss.</p>
+    <h2>No third-party requests</h2>
+    <p>Images and styles are served from this site. Visiting a page does not contact an external image provider, font service, or analytics company. The coffee photograph was sourced from Unsplash and is hosted locally.</p>
+    <h2>How data is handled</h2>
+    <p>The application does not retain personal records, request bodies, or access logs. Hosting providers and network infrastructure may process connection information and maintain their own operational logs; their retention and access controls depend on the deployment.</p>
+    <h2>Protection built in</h2>
+    <p>The site restricts scripts, external connections, and sensitive browser permissions. Referrer information is not shared when you follow links. Production hosting must provide HTTPS to protect information in transit.</p>
+    <h2>Reviewing our providers</h2>
+    <p>Changes that introduce a provider or data collection require a review of the purpose, information shared, retention, access controls, and deletion options. No independent third-party audit has been completed for this application.</p>
+    <h2>Your choices</h2>
+    <p>There is no saved visitor profile or application-held personal information to export or delete. You can browse without supplying personal details. Any future account or ordering service will need its own privacy information before collecting data.</p>
+    <p><a href="/">Return to The Daily Grind</a></p>
+  </main>
+  <footer>
+    <div class="footer-links">
+      <a href="/about">Our Story</a> |
+      <a href="/careers">Join the Team</a> |
+      <a href="/contact">Contact Us</a> |
+      <a href="/privacy-policy">Privacy</a>
+    </div>
+    <p>&copy; 2026 The Daily Grind Coffee Co. All rights reserved.</p>
+</footer>
+</body>
+</html>
